# T12: each island writes its copy of w (1, 2, 0, 0 and 0, 0, 3, 4), merge makes both 1, 2, 3, 4; a plain tensor for w, and w for x, are invalid.
options workers 4 islands 2,2
tensor x f32 128 32 fill tile+1
tensor w f32 128 32 replicated
invoke Spread.learn x w 4:u32 on 0 4
read w
control merge w
read w
invoke Spread.learn x x 4:u32 on 0 4
invoke Spread.learn w w 4:u32 on 0 4
